type: software
title: "Numerical Scaling Collapse and Systematic Exclusion Analysis for Localized EFCL Corrections in Quantum Tunneling"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-25
authors:
  - family-names: "Al-Shtaiwi"
    given-names: "Ibrahim Ramadan"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Libya"
