url: "https://github.com/ibrhimrmden-eng/EFCL-Quantum-Tunneling"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - quantum tunneling
  - WKB approximation
  - scaling collapse
  - numerical reproducibility
  - log-derivative method
  - Riccati equation
  - EFCL
abstract: >
  Numerically exact investigation of a proposed environment-dependent
  correction (EFCL) to one-dimensional quantum tunneling through a
  smooth potential barrier, using a validated logarithmic-derivative
  (Riccati) solver. Reports a robust numerical scaling collapse in the
  coupling-suppression relationship and a systematic exclusion analysis
  of eleven candidate first-order semiclassical and single-channel
  scattering observables as explanations for the underlying critical
  scale lambda*(E).
